### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Wet Road with Reduced Visibility" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition, :RainyCondition .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Wet road surface with reflective sheen" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Reflective light patterns on wet road indicating poor traction" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk2 .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to nighttime and rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road conditions due to wet surface" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Adverse weather (nighttime + rain) reducing driver awareness" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

